// PublicGetLastSettlementsByCurrency performs a GET /public/get_last_settlements_by_currency (the `PublicGetLastSettlementsByCurrency` operationId) request.
//
// Retrieves historical settlement, delivery, and bankruptcy events from all instruments within a given currency.
